---
---
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="container hero__content">
    <div class="hero__badge reveal is-visible"><span class="hero__badge-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Newly founded · In memory of Elsie Jelagat</div>

    <h1 class="hero__title reveal is-visible">
      In every heart,<br>there is <em>hope.</em>
    </h1>

    <p class="hero__sub reveal is-visible">
      EJ Hope Foundation is brand new — built on one promise: no one should face a dark moment alone. Free, confidential support rooted in compassion, community, and the memory of Elsie Jelagat. We're just getting started.
    </p>

    <div class="hero__cta reveal is-visible">
      <a href="#programs" class="btn btn--primary">Find Support</a>
      <a href="#stories" class="btn btn--outline">Our Promise</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero{
    position:relative;
    padding:clamp(5rem,11vw,8rem) 0;
    text-align:center;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#FFF7EE 0%,var(--surface) 100%);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--outline-variant);
  }

  .hero__content{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;}

  .hero__badge{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;
    font-size:.78rem;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.02em;
    color:var(--primary);
    background:var(--primary-container);
    padding:.5rem 1.1rem;border-radius:var(--radius-xs);
    margin-bottom:clamp(1.5rem,3.5vw,2rem);
  }
  .hero__badge-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--primary);}

  .hero__title{
    font-size:clamp(2.6rem,7vw,4.4rem);
    line-height:1.08;
    letter-spacing:-0.02em;
    font-weight:600;
  }
  .hero__title em{font-style:italic;color:var(--primary);}

  .hero__sub{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:clamp(1.02rem,2.2vw,1.18rem);
    max-width:600px;margin:1.4rem auto 0;
    line-height:1.7;
  }

  .hero__cta{display:flex;gap:.9rem;justify-content:center;margin-top:2.2rem;flex-wrap:wrap;}
</style>